      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 35,
       "endIndex": 157,
       "text": "At first glance, Google\u2019s offer appears to be an annualized **$552,000/yr** ($235k base + $47k bonus + $270k equity avg)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 159,
       "endIndex": 262,
       "text": "However, Google uses a **front-loaded vesting schedule (33% / 33% / 22% / 12%)** for initial RSU grants"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 483,
       "endIndex": 519,
       "text": "| **RSU Vesting** | $356,400 *(33%)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 483,
       "endIndex": 538,
       "text": "| **RSU Vesting** | $356,400 *(33%)* | $356,400 *(33%)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 483,
       "endIndex": 557,
       "text": "| **RSU Vesting** | $356,400 *(33%)* | $356,400 *(33%)* | $237,600 *(22%)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 483,
       "endIndex": 576,
       "text": "| **RSU Vesting** | $356,400 *(33%)* | $356,400 *(33%)* | $237,600 *(22%)* | $129,600 *(12%)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 811,
       "endIndex": 873,
       "text": "**Years 3 & 4 (The Cliff):** Your initial equity drops steeply"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       4,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 875,
       "endIndex": 975,
       "text": "While Google\u2019s annual refresher grants (which typically vest 25% per year) will help backfill this"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 875,
       "endIndex": 1036,
       "text": "While Google\u2019s annual refresher grants (which typically vest 25% per year) will help backfill this, they are tied to performance ratings and are not guaranteed"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       4,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1255,
       "endIndex": 1432,
       "text": "**Missing Sign-on Bonus:** Google provided **$0 sign-on**, despite poaching a happy, well-compensated Meta IC6 who is leaving behind unvested equity and performance cycle timing"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       4,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1571,
       "endIndex": 1662,
       "text": "$1.08M in RSUs is right around the 50th\u201360th percentile for Google L6 PMs in the Bay Area"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2146,
       "endIndex": 2317,
       "text": "**Band Headroom:** Your base salary of $235k is well below the top of the posted range ($271k), and L6 equity grants can stretch up to $1.2M\u2013$1.35M for competitive hires"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2357,
       "endIndex": 2495,
       "text": "When negotiating with Google, the easiest levers for recruiters to move are **Sign-on Bonus** (one-time cash budget) and **Equity (GSUs)**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2497,
       "endIndex": 2616,
       "text": "Base salary increases require strict band calibration, but you should still ask to at least beat your current Meta base"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       1,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3104,
       "endIndex": 3247,
       "text": "**Sign-on ($80k ask):** Compensates for the unvested Meta RSUs you forfeit in the immediate short term and bridges any bonus cycle misalignment"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       4,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3251,
       "endIndex": 3352,
       "text": "**Equity ($1.25M ask):** Lifts Year 1 & 2 compensation past ~$700k and cushions the Year 3/4 drop-off"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4468,
       "endIndex": 4666,
       "text": "If Google meets you halfway (e.g., ~$245k base, $50k sign-on, $1.15M\u2013$1.2M stock), you will be looking at **~$715k in Year 1 total compensation**, which makes the transition financially worthwhile"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       3
      ]
     }
